            "heading": "Ordering & delivery",
            "open_by_default": true,
            "open_first_question": true,
            "question_1": "Are these pieces already made, or built after I order?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Almost everything is made to order. Once your order, payment, and any required customization approvals are confirmed, artisans begin your piece. Before packing, we send final photos or video for your confirmation, which helps reduce surprises before the piece ships.</p>",
            "question_2": "How long until my piece arrives?",
            "answer_2": "<p>For most standard orders delivered to eligible destinations worldwide, plan on roughly <strong>18 to 25 business days</strong> in total: about 15 to 20 business days of processing and production, then about 3 to 5 business days in transit. Oversized, customized, or specially handled pieces can take longer, and we tell you if that applies to yours.</p>",
            "question_3": "Is shipping really included?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Yes. Complimentary standard shipping is included on every order delivered to an eligible address worldwide, with no minimum order value. Optional extras such as expedited transport, installation, or storage are quoted separately and always confirmed with you before anything is booked.</p>"
