            "heading": "Returns & condition",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "open_first_question": false,
            "question_1": "Can I return a piece if I change my mind?",
            "answer_1": "<p>No. All WRYDECO purchases are final sale. We cannot accept returns, exchanges, or refunds for change of mind, a different finish preference, or a piece that does not fit the space after delivery. Custom and made-to-order orders may be changed or cancelled only where permitted by policy, so speak to us before ordering if anything is uncertain.</p>",
            "question_2": "What happens if my piece arrives damaged?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Contact us within <strong>30 calendar days</strong> of delivery with your order number, clear photographs of the piece, all packaging, the shipping label, and any visible damage. Include video evidence where the issue is best demonstrated by video. We will review the claim and arrange an appropriate resolution. Please do not send anything back before we have given you written instructions.</p>",
            "question_3": "",
            "answer_3": ""
          }
